rong>You've Changed</strong> features a mysterious story mode and a highly re-playable arcade mode. Notes and extras are available in a separate Lore menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556110/extras/694dcb86fc05c38eb2ff1536bd2a60e0.avif?t=1753297007\" width=614 height=338 /></span></p>",
